 city, connected to hundreds more across the region, alongside major art and cultural attractions.</p><p>That makes Bentonville a different kind of Ozark base: ride, hike, eat, see art and then jump back into the hills without changing where you sleep.</p></article><aside class="card"><div class="stat"><b>~70 mi</b><span>city trail network highlighted by Arkansas Tourism</span></div><div class="stat"><b>400+ mi</b><span>regional trail connections</span></div><div class="stat"><b>Art + outdoors</b><span>the signature Bentonville combination</span></div></aside></section><div class="head"><h2>Choose your Bentonville day</h2></div><section class="tiles"><a class="tile" href="/guides/bentonville-mountain-biking"><span class="num">01 · BIKE</span><h3>Ride the trails</h3><p>Build a ride from beginner-friendly city paths to technical Ozark singletrack.</p></a><a class="tile" href="/adventures"><span class="num">02 · OUTDOORS</span><h3>Keep exploring</h3><p>Connect Bentonville with Hobbs, Beaver Lake, Devil's Den and the wider Ozark trail network.</p></a><a class="tile" href="/guides/about-the-ozarks"><span class="num">03 · ART</span><h3>See Crystal Bridges</h3><p>Pair outdoor time with one of the region's defining cultural destinations.</p></a><a class="tile" href="/guides/best-lakes-in-the-ozarks"><span class="num">04 · WATER</span><h3>Hit Beaver Lake</h3><p>Trade pedals for paddles and water time just beyond town.</p></a><a class="tile" href="/guides/ozarks-weekend-getaway"><span class="num">05 · FOOD</span><h3>Make it a weekend</h3><p>Mix downtown restaurants, coffee, art and trail time into one easy getaway.</p></a><a class="tile" href="/listings"><span class="num">06 · STAY</span><h3>Choose your base</h3><p>Find lodging that keeps you close to trails, downtown and the next adventure.</p></a></section><div class="head"><h2>Build the trip</h2></div><section class="plans"><article class="plan"><h3>Bike weekend</h3><p>Ride Friday afternoon, make Saturday your big trail day and finish with downtown food.</p><a href="/guides/bentonville-mountain-biking">Plan the ride →</a></article><article class="plan"><h3>Art + outdoors</h3><p>Pair Crystal Bridges with trails, parks and a Beaver Lake sunset.</p><a href="/destinations/beaver-lake">Add Beaver Lake →</a></article><article class="plan"><h3>Ozark circuit</h3><p>Use Bentonville as the northwest anchor for a larger regional road trip.</p><a href="/guides/ozarks-road-trip">Build the circuit →</a></article></section><section class="card owner"><h2>Own a Bentonville-area business?</h2><p>Hotels, cabins, restaurants, bike shops, guides, attractions and experiences can claim a founding destination listing.</p><a class="btn primary" href="/list-your-cabin">Claim a free founding spot →</a></section><div class="disclosure">OzarkRoost is an independent travel directory. Trail conditions, attraction hours, events, prices and access can change. Verify current information before traveling.</div></main></body></html>